  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f544102aba673c9bed57586dfa32f39619cf42b385c409816bd6b7801ecdf755c%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4d45727a4d49392e706e67\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/544102aba673c9bed57586dfa32f39619cf42b385c409816bd6b7801ecdf755c/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4d45727a4d49392e706e67\" alt=\"TooManyOrigins 横幅\"></a></p>\n<p>也试试 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252forigins-minus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Origins Minus</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/golemancy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Golemancy</a>！</p>\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1>依赖项</h1>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric</th>\n<th>Forge</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9296b230044bb4ef07851ff9baa2d04aeb210baee3467abafff1380fa081f08b/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4f6c31546366382e706e67\" width=\"215\" height=\"72\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/origins\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/ce178edbfbcfee90f2674e5643dcb636455af891e329cee910c3a64db9f7f3b6/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f6d4f59533036352e706e67\" alt=\"\" width=\"215\" height=\"72\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/origins-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/ce178edbfbcfee90f2674e5643dcb636455af891e329cee910c3a64db9f7f3b6/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f6d4f59533036352e706e67\" alt=\"\" width=\"215\" height=\"72\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1>简介</h1>\n<p>TooManyOrigins 是 Origins 模组的插件，旨在扩充起源列表。新增的起源灵感部分来源于原版起源以及我个人喜欢的其他起源。</p>\n<p>虽然它们的设计主要围绕自身机制与基础模组的起源，但已优化为可在大多数 Origins 模组环境中游玩。欢迎随意与数据包、插件等搭配使用。</p>\n<p>您完全可以随心所欲地修改模组中的起源。<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fapugli\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apugli</a> 对自定义支持极佳，几乎所有内容都可通过数据包进行修改。</p>\n<p>它同时支持 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/origins\" rel=\"nofollow\">Origins (Fabric)</a>（也与 Quilt 兼容）及其非官方的 Forge 移植版 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/origins-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Origins (Forge)</a>。</p>\n<p>任何反馈或错误报告请发布至我的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/UBfEjsANNz\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/MerchantPug/toomanyorigins/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Issues 页面</a>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1>包含五个全新起源……</h1>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fMerchantPug%252fapugli-docs%252f1.20%252fdocs%252fimages%252ftmoHareBannerRework.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MerchantPug/apugli-docs/1.20/docs/images/tmoHareBannerRework.png\" alt=\"兔系起源横幅\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fMerchantPug%252fapugli-docs%252f1.20%252fdocs%252fimages%252ftmoHisskinBannerRework.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MerchantPug/apugli-docs/1.20/docs/images/tmoHisskinBannerRework.png\" alt=\"嘶鸣裔起源横幅\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fMerchantPug%252fapugli-docs%252f1.20%252fdocs%252fimages%252ftmoDragonbornBannerRework.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MerchantPug/apugli-docs/1.20/docs/images/tmoDragonbornBannerRework.png\" alt=\"龙裔起源横幅\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fMerchantPug%252fapugli-docs%252f1.20%252fdocs%252fimages%252ftmoSwarmBannerRework.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MerchantPug/apugli-docs/1.20/docs/images/tmoSwarmBannerRework.png\" alt=\"虫群起源横幅\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fMerchantPug%252fapugli-docs%252f1.20%252fdocs%252fimages%252ftmoWitheredBannerRework.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MerchantPug/apugli-docs/1.20/docs/images/tmoWitheredBannerRework.png\" alt=\"凋零起源横幅\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>更详细的起源说明请通过 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fapugli.readthedocs.io%252fen%252flatest%252fmisc%252fbase_contents%252forigins%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">此页面</a> 查看。</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1>下载</h1>\n<p>点击对应的模组加载器图标，即可跳转至仅包含该加载器文件的下载页面。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toomanyorigins/files?page=1&pageSize=20&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/e7713b898ac58fb36a5c7c34be49d20fab836efbbb424f0861d56f473dfabc15/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f576e447875336b2e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toomanyorigins/files?page=1&pageSize=20&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/bcd1e218c7962b7e1fe52b10c34f7ae1cc1af1397ccf81963c7b0c5d7617ce96/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f71746863304e652e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1>我想要旧版内容！</h1>\n<p>若要获取 1.0.0 版本之前的起源，您可以在创建世界界面中应用相关数据包，或 <a href=\"https://github.com/MerchantPug/legacy-toomanyorigins-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此处</a> 下载。</p>",
